WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.920
The past isn't dead.

2
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.840
James. Fate draws us back together.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Now your enemy is my enemy.

4
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.040
-His name is Safin.
-And what does he want?

5
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.840
Revenge. Me.

6
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.120
When our secret finds its way out,

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
it'll be the death of you.

8
00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.360
You can imagine why
I've come back to play.

9
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.000
There's a young lady in Santiago
I want you to meet.

10
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.960
-You're late.
-When you're ready.

11
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.320
Salute!

12
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.600
I met your new Double O.
She's a disarming young woman.

13
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.480
I get why you shot him.

14
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.520
Yeah well, everyone tries at least once.

15
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.560
James Bond.
